  legacy:
    desc: [dzimke, dschimke, schimke DIA]
    article: <p><strong><em>Zemīks</em></strong> pertikka ezze deināprusiskan wīrdan <em>dzimke</em> (dīgi - <em>dschimke, schimke</em>), kawīds bēi ezze pōliskan ziomek "<em>tautīns, taweinīns</em>".</p>\n<p>Plutenīkai. Zmānes, kawīdai plaudinna pluttans.</p>\n<p>Zemīkai plūwa sen pluttans ukadeznimai po Mēmelis appin. </p>\n<p><a href="https://wiki.genealogy.net/images/6/66/DzimkenMemel.jpg">https://wiki.genealogy.net/images/6/66/DzimkenMemel.jpg</a></p>\n<p><a href="https://wiki.genealogy.net/images/e/e9/Dzimken.jpg">https://wiki.genealogy.net/images/e/e9/Dzimken.jpg</a></p>\n<p> </p>
